#. module: mental_therapy
#: model:mail.template,body_html:mental_therapy.booking_suggestion
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"                Hello,\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Thank you for your presence. May I invite you to schedule "
"your next appointment if needed?\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Looking forward to meeting you.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            \n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/book/"
"therapy_session\">Schedule an Appointment</a>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"                ສະບາຍດີ,\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                ຂໍຂອບໃຈມາຍັງທ່ານທີ່ມາຮ່ວມ. ພວກເຮົາຂໍເຊີນທ່ານກຳນົດເວລານັດໝາຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານ ຖ້າ"
"ຫາກວ່າມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ?\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                ຫວັງຢ່າງຍິ່ງວ່າຈະໄດ້ພົບກັບທ່ານ.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            \n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/book/"
"therapy_session\">ກຳນົດເວລານັດໝາຍ</a>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        "

